tor Type: LC Duplex Interface","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty: 1 Year","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <h2>Fortinet FN-TRAN-SX 1000BASE-SX SFP Module – 850nm LC MMF Fiber Transceiver (Up to 550m)</h2><p>Upgrade your Fortinet-powered network with the Fortinet FN-TRAN-SX, a high-performance 1000BASE-SX Gigabit SFP transceiver module designed for short-distance multi-mode fiber (MMF) connections. Ideal for enterprise data centers, ISP edge deployments, and campus networks in Bangladesh, this hot-swappable SFP ensures seamless integration with FortiGate, FortiSwitch, and other Fortinet appliances.</p><p>Operating at an 850nm wavelength over LC duplex connectors, it delivers reliable Gigabit connectivity up to 550 meters using OM2 multimode fiber. Built for energy efficiency and long-term stability, this module is a dependable choice for high-density fiber deployments.</p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li>Transceiver Type: 1000BASE-SX SFP (Gigabit Ethernet)</li><li>Wavelength: 850nm for short-range MMF communication</li><li>Fiber Type: Multi-Mode Fiber (OM2/OM3)</li><li>Transmission Distance: Up to 550 meters on 50/125 µm MMF</li><li>Connector Type: LC Duplex Interface</li><li>Data Rate: 1.25 Gbps full-duplex bandwidth</li><li>Hot-Swappable: Yes – for easy replacement and upgrades</li><li>Compatible with: FortiGate firewalls, FortiSwitch switches, and other Fortinet devices</li><li>Form Factor: SFP (Small Form-Factor Pluggable)</li><li>Power Efficiency: Low power consumption with high performance</li><li>Build Quality: Enterprise-grade durability and stability</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Cisco SFP-10G-SR 10GBASE-SR SFP+ Module","href":"/cisco-sfp-10g-sr-10gbase-sr-sfp-module","now":"700৳","old":"800৳","single":""},{"name"